    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22908" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γρῡπ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hook-nosed, aquiline</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιμός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.4.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				474d
			</span></i>, etc.: generally, <i>hooked</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνυχες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SA</u>
					2.1
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SD</u>
				1.8
			</span></i>; <i>curved</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γρυπὴ
			γαστήρ</span> a <i>round</i> paunch, <i><span class="en">
				X.
			</span></i> l. c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. στέφανος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
					105
